# Flutter Mobile Rules

## Structure (Clean Architecture)
```
lib/
├── core/           # App-wide: config, theme, network client
│   ├── config/
│   ├── theme/
│   └── network/
├── features/       # Feature modules (perks, auth, etc.)
│   └── <feature>/
│       ├── data/           # Repositories, data sources
│       ├── domain/         # Entities, use cases
│       └── presentation/  # Screens, widgets, state
└── shared/         # Shared widgets, utilities
    └── widgets/
```

## Code Style
- Follow `flutter_lints` (configured in `analysis_options.yaml`)
- Use `const` constructors wherever possible
- Prefer composition over inheritance for widgets
- Use Material 3 (`useMaterial3: true`)
- Named parameters for widget constructors

## Testing
- Widget tests in `test/`
- Run: `cd apps/mobile && flutter test`
- Analyze: `cd apps/mobile && flutter analyze`

## API Integration
- All API calls go through `ApiClient` in `core/network/`
- Use repository pattern in `features/<feature>/data/`
- API base URL configured in `core/config/api_config.dart`
